{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっ！\nみーんなが大好きな国！！\nいいひひひひ\n夢の国！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってきたでーす❤!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーランド最高よ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもよりもすごく空いてて乗り物乗り放題でした↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んちゃぁ～ちゃちゃ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェットコースター乗ってる時ね、\n奈央と「俺が...俺が優勝だーーーっっ！！！！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って何度も連呼して叫んでた❤元気なの。あみってそんとに。\nそんとにだって！ほんとにっ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今度一緒に行こうね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこのあなたさーん！！\nシュガー味のチュロスおごってくれないと怒だよあみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみね～\n見てて思ったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミッキーとかあーいう可愛いキャラクターの中に入って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい子供達とか赤ちゃんをニッコニコにさせてあげたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根っからのエンターテイナーはやっぱりそう思ってしまうわけよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとメイク濃いめあみあみ（o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽいあみあみ姉さんもね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手手にゃんにゃんだよーーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ここで突然の新コーナーね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あみあみの最新情報ぷりーずいえい。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このコーナーではあみあみの最も最新情報をいち早く皆様にお届けするというコーナーでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆わたくしジムに通いはじめました！！\n歩いて歩いて走って走って腹筋鍛えておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆手帳をつけはじめたでおる！！\nその日あった出来事をね？カキカキ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーなんですわたくし、ただいまトレーニングセンターにて\nこのたいしゃの悪さを改善すべく、華麗で美しい汗を流すべく頑張って走ってるんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の目標を達成するためには頑張らなくてはならないのよ  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今年の目標を知ってるのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の東京全国握手会にて抽選会の商品、メンバーから直筆絵馬に書いてあるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの絵馬が当たった方しか知りません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この答えは今年の最後の日に書くね❤❤❤"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？待ちきれないって？\n遅いって？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーんな...あーた、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのブログを1年間しっかり見てくれればたいしたことないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃーんと1年間あみあみブログ応援、そしてコメントよろしくね(o^^o)んちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれないと......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうだっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃぁぁあああぁぁああーーーっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていっ。おりゃっ。えいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参ったか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hahahaha！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/01/23/8595779/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}